      "context_hash": 15903203284604366710,
      "translation": "`writeback`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609082Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Metadata only; data can be written after metadata",
      "source_hash": 1675710617364212722,
      "context_hash": 10551978794818462781,
      "translation": "메타데이터만; 데이터는 메타데이터 이후에 기록될 수 있음",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "metadata": "메타데이터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609082Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Fastest",
      "source_hash": 9900968932385671411,
      "context_hash": 3406509795716806659,
      "translation": "가장 빠름",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609082Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Data may be corrupted after crash",
      "source_hash": 15382561871781880322,
      "context_hash": 12536755159988132723,
      "translation": "크래시 후 데이터가 손상될 수 있음",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609082Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "`ordered`",
      "source_hash": 11601602415345263641,
      "context_hash": 337560027260748548,
      "translation": "`ordered`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609082Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Metadata only; **data written before metadata**",
      "source_hash": 10706549876734603463,
      "context_hash": 7000148061858226477,
      "translation": "메타데이터만; **데이터를 메타데이터보다 먼저 기록**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "metadata": "메타데이터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609082Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Good",
      "source_hash": 9937313922708934293,
      "context_hash": 1425475205671347234,
      "translation": "좋음",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Good": "좋음"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:25:46.532051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Data blocks committed before metadata",
      "source_hash": 11270652667504394706,
      "context_hash": 482591296065069977,
      "translation": "데이터 블록을 메타데이터보다 먼저 커밋",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "metadata": "메타데이터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609083Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "`journal`",
      "source_hash": 10911796322739453763,
      "context_hash": 18262667852996078117,
      "translation": "`journal`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609083Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Both metadata and data",
      "source_hash": 159446557283262573,
      "context_hash": 5321947395486629112,
      "translation": "메타데이터와 데이터 모두",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "metadata": "메타데이터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609083Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "Slowest",
      "source_hash": 111763306554331058,
      "context_hash": 881351983690999635,
      "translation": "가장 느림",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609083Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "Strongest",
      "source_hash": 8316931687664042229,
      "context_hash": 14318662144084282601,
      "translation": "가장 강함",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609083Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "Default is `ordered`: metadata changes are atomic, data blocks are guaranteed to be written before the metadata that references them.",
      "source_hash": 14404027866999403047,
      "context_hash": 17658955123509910640,
      "translation": "기본값은 `ordered`입니다. 메타데이터 변경은 원자적이며, 데이터 블록은 이를 참조하는 메타데이터보다 먼저 기록되는 것이 보장됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "metadata": "메타데이터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609084Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "JBD2: the journaling layer",
      "source_hash": 3522216047817507889,
      "context_hash": 3546730963155247819,
      "translation": "JBD2: 저널링 계층",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609084Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "ext4 uses JBD2 (Journaling Block Device 2) as its journaling layer.",
      "source_hash": 17087531369710260783,
      "context_hash": 11373826588233329421,
      "translation": "ext4는 저널링 계층으로 JBD2(Journaling Block Device 2, 저널링 블록 디바이스 2)를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "block device": "블록 디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:25:46.532052Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "JBD2 is independent of ext4 — it could journal any block device.",
      "source_hash": 17342114915849549607,
      "context_hash": 10670959041881441655,
      "translation": "JBD2는 ext4와 독립적이며, 어떤 블록 디바이스든 저널링할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "block device": "블록 디바이스",
        "journal": "저널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609084Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Journal layout on disk",
      "source_hash": 6696676608463705158,
      "context_hash": 2179495664465619534,
      "translation": "디스크상의 저널 레이아웃",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "journal": "저널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609085Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The journal superblock records `s_start` (tail) and `s_sequence` (current transaction).",
      "source_hash": 15583593149564159181,
      "context_hash": 18277037765241641519,
      "translation": "저널 슈퍼블록은 `s_start`(tail)와 `s_sequence`(현재 트랜잭션)를 기록합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "journal": "저널",
        "transaction": "트랜잭션"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609085Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Recovery replays all transactions from `s_start` to the last valid commit block.",
      "source_hash": 1917066003103464889,
      "context_hash": 10147923128954686001,
      "translation": "복구 과정은 `s_start`부터 마지막 유효 커밋 블록까지의 모든 트랜잭션을 재생합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "transaction": "트랜잭션"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609085Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "struct journal_t",
      "source_hash": 6609423964073661212,
      "context_hash": 11040335988235785276,
      "translation": "struct journal_t",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609085Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "struct transaction_t",
      "source_hash": 12565855381280086999,
      "context_hash": 8919262831827371381,
      "translation": "struct transaction_t",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:22.609085Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Transaction lifecycle",
      "source_hash": 16007798137781690269,
      "context_hash": 15169518679123171092,
      "translation": "트랜잭션 수명 주기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "transaction": "트랜잭션"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 1: begin",
      "source_hash": 16150855264769111065,
      "context_hash": 13014228657171482066,
      "translation": "1단계: 시작",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 2: modify buffers",
      "source_hash": 7198449954545581245,
      "context_hash": 2890847847141983289,
      "translation": "2단계: 버퍼 수정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005239Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 3: commit (kjournald)",
      "source_hash": 6731172311724469535,
      "context_hash": 2786120591063734172,
      "translation": "3단계: 커밋 (kjournald)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005239Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Commit phases:",
      "source_hash": 4825859137205960379,
      "context_hash": 12803542600710058764,
      "translation": "커밋 단계:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005239Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "**Close**: stop accepting new handles for this transaction (T_LOCKED)",
      "source_hash": 13130634479125423704,
      "context_hash": 14670280420126793609,
      "translation": "**닫기**: 이 트랜잭션에 대한 새 핸들 수락 중단 (T_LOCKED)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "transaction": "트랜잭션"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005239Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "**Write descriptor**: write the descriptor block listing all modified buffers",
      "source_hash": 6308763627185250402,
      "context_hash": 4733327202707652864,
      "translation": "**디스크립터 쓰기**: 수정된 모든 버퍼를 나열하는 디스크립터 블록 쓰기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "descriptor": "디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005239Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "**Write data**: write all modified metadata buffers to the journal",
      "source_hash": 8258485018917427539,
      "context_hash": 16358057179250342309,
      "translation": "**데이터 쓰기**: 수정된 모든 메타데이터 버퍼를 저널에 쓰기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "journal": "저널",
        "metadata": "메타데이터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005239Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "**Flush**: wait for all journal writes to complete",
      "source_hash": 18216397231260438176,
      "context_hash": 7394054062179206940,
      "translation": "**플러시**: 모든 저널 쓰기가 완료될 때까지 대기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "journal": "저널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005239Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "**Write commit block**: write the commit block with the transaction's sequence number",
      "source_hash": 5092078472626030508,
      "context_hash": 10377078224079739355,
      "translation": "**커밋 블록 쓰기**: 트랜잭션의 시퀀스 번호가 담긴 커밋 블록 쓰기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "transaction": "트랜잭션"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005239Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "**Checkpoint**: once the commit block is on disk, the filesystem blocks can be written in place",
      "source_hash": 10734314084478407927,
      "context_hash": 12322206113869653653,
      "translation": "**체크포인트**: 커밋 블록이 디스크에 기록되면 파일시스템 블록을 제자리에 쓸 수 있음",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005240Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "**Free**: after checkpoint, free journal space",
      "source_hash": 5565501309952551299,
      "context_hash": 11283089028778237694,
      "translation": "**해제**: 체크포인트 후 저널 공간 해제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "journal": "저널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005240Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 4: checkpoint",
      "source_hash": 14664382510560172545,
      "context_hash": 3771708222583030946,
      "translation": "4단계: 체크포인트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005240Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "After committing, the original filesystem blocks must be written out (checkpointed) before the journal space can be reused:",
      "source_hash": 12240672249660760223,
      "context_hash": 15434786482490791578,
      "translation": "커밋 후에는 저널 공간을 재사용하기 전에 원래 파일시스템 블록을 기록(체크포인트)해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "journal": "저널"
      },
