    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Crash recovery",
      "source_hash": 13065857586514179489,
      "context_hash": 8905178345049729553,
      "translation": "크래시 복구",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005240Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Kernel journal recovery",
      "source_hash": 10088953502820143959,
      "context_hash": 12336136596983050529,
      "translation": "커널 저널 복구",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "journal": "저널",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005240Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Recovery is **O(journal size)**, not O(filesystem size).",
      "source_hash": 5264674193863672172,
      "context_hash": 12499221886524837951,
      "translation": "복구는 O(파일시스템 크기)가 아니라 **O**(저널 크기)입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "journal": "저널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005240Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Even a 2TB filesystem recovers in seconds because only the journal (default 128MB) is replayed.",
      "source_hash": 820315702142269680,
      "context_hash": 17065613400420101595,
      "translation": "저널(기본 128MB)만 재생하므로 2TB 파일시스템도 몇 초 만에 복구됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "journal": "저널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005240Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Fast commit (ext4 5.10+)",
      "source_hash": 14732635633374438155,
      "context_hash": 12561529058304335624,
      "translation": "Fast commit (ext4 5.10+)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005240Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "JBD2 full commits are expensive (hundreds of microseconds). **Fast commit** is an optimized path for common operations:",
      "source_hash": 6992363012559542340,
      "context_hash": 6853281237161170990,
      "translation": "JBD2 전체 커밋은 비용이 큽니다(수백 마이크로초). **Fast commit**은 일반적인 작업을 위한 최적화된 경로입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005241Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "ext4 journaling vs fsync",
      "source_hash": 12730269700276367004,
      "context_hash": 9933571586436060407,
      "translation": "ext4 저널링과 fsync 비교",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005241Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The journal only guarantees metadata consistency after crash.",
      "source_hash": 5692440032736438309,
      "context_hash": 5073945629825428988,
      "translation": "저널은 크래시 후 메타데이터 일관성만 보장합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "journal": "저널",
        "metadata": "메타데이터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:03:09.005241Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Data durability requires `fsync()` or `O_SYNC`.",
      "source_hash": 7756452111482298230,
      "context_hash": 7681444323857652403,
      "translation": "데이터 내구성을 보장하려면 `fsync()` 또는 `O_SYNC`가 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "durability": "내구성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:25:46.532052Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Monitoring journal performance",
